# Generated test artwork, verification output and screenshots. Recreated by
# `pnpm run fixtures`; nothing here is an input to the build.
tmp/

# Deliberately NOT ignored, despite being generated:
#
#   apps/web/public/samples/*      the sample images the landing page offers
#   apps/web/src/lib/sample-stats.json   their measured conversion stats
#
# Both are produced from tmp/fixtures by `pnpm run samples`, and both are needed by
# `next build`. Committing them keeps a fresh clone buildable without first
# generating fixtures, and keeps the figures the landing page prints under review in
# diffs — if a change makes the tracer worse, it shows up here.
